  "summary": "How to pick the right purpose-built database for a scenario: the questions to ask, the database families (relational, key-value, document, wide-column, graph, in-memory, object, warehouse, search, time series), a recap of RDS, Aurora, ElastiCache, DynamoDB and S3, and the specialists DocumentDB (MongoDB), Neptune (graphs, Neptune Streams), Keyspaces (Cassandra) and Timestream, including the 2025 availability changes for Timestream for LiveAnalytics and QLDB.",
